; Active offhand — Shield Generator. RMB activates a 25% damage
; reduction buff that absorbs up to 200 damage before breaking.
; cooldown applies AFTER the break, not on activation, so a player
; who never gets hit can leave the buff up indefinitely.
;
; active_kind = SHIELD_BUFF (3 in the enum: NONE, SHIELD_HOLD, GRENADE,
; SHIELD_BUFF). targeting_mode is unused for active_kind != NONE but
; left at default since the enum has no NONE member.

